ation of ONE-chan's skirt being pulled up from the front and her panties being pulled up so that all of her underwear can be seen.\n\nThe expression and reaction of the ONE girl should be based on the reaction of the ONE girl that you feel.\n\nIf this amount is not enough, please resend it to us.\n\nThank you very much in advance.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MAME_CIVA/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed9e0757/uploads/origins/8b96c9e5-a1ba-4aa4-9210-ea61fdb6dff1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad1e52cc173ba2166e437f956196031f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed9e0757/uploads/origins/8b96c9e5-a1ba-4aa4-9210-ea61fdb6dff1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad1e52cc173ba2166e437f956196031f, https://si.imgix.net/ed9e0757/uploads/origins/8b96c9e5-a1ba-4aa4-9210-ea61fdb6dff1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd38f2e3a2a4ce1dbc11438f3ecc6a8a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed9e0757/uploads/origins/8b96c9e5-a1ba-4aa4-9210-ea61fdb6dff1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6320be54e9811338dec505f9e699d49 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Sensitive Yukari, please.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MAME_CIVA/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/17a1abb8/uploads/origins/9d561024-d097-4297-addd-1149579c710b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4173c9bf1af81c7323e4ddeaa05c9658", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/17a1abb8/uploads/origins/9d561024-d097-4297-addd-1149579c710b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4173c9bf1af81c7323e4ddeaa05c9658, https://si.imgix.net/17a1abb8/uploads/origins/9d561024-d097-4297-addd-1149579c710b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a448b34d40ded2e79cf408f9e2202bb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/17a1abb8/uploads/origins/9d561024-d097-4297-addd-1149579c710b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56b93428d9f5878e7412bc37aa9bc953 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。\nTwitterで投稿された葵ちゃんやゆかりさんのイラストを見て、\n内容がとても好みでしたので依頼させていただきました。\n\n葵ちゃんの頭を撫でて微笑む結月ゆかりと、\n気恥ずかしさを覚えて頬を赤くする琴葉葵のイラストを描いていただきたいです。\n\n■キャラクター\n結月ゆかり、琴葉葵\n\n以上の内容でお願いいたします。\n指定していない部分はお任せいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MAME_CIVA/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2892cf7c/uploads/origins/a200c0f6-5b65-4884-851a-f8dcc2151bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d39d4a8148d26e3ca965977275ad682c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2892cf7c/uploads/origins/a200c0f6-5b65-4884-851a-f8dcc2151bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d39d4a8148d26e3ca965977275ad682c, https://si.imgix.net/2892cf7c/uploads/origins/a200c0f6-5b65-4884-851a-f8dcc2151bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b804e522d5c7ceaad28929f326c2d8eb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2892cf7c/uploads/origins/a200c0f6-5b65-4884-851a-f8dcc2151bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b370479f288029a023ec2d0837914d3e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Please show Akari Tsunagiboshi (bud) and her guardian Yukari Yuzuki (drop) playing in a kiddie pool.\nPlease have them both in swimsuits.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MAME_CIVA/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7d52ab49/uploads/origins/5dceaefe-47cb-428a-bf20-6224284a0024?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90dc52d2b3fe018d05744e2657fd6650", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7d52ab49/uploads/origins/5dceaefe-47cb-428a-bf20-6224284a0024?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90dc52d2b3fe018d05744e2657fd6650, https://si.imgix.net/7d52ab49/uploads/origins/5dceaefe-47cb-428a-bf20-6224284a0024?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6709d539e0f19e9bfc1bb799c56beac5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7d52ab49/uploads/origins/5dceaefe-47cb-428a-bf20-6224284a0024?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00956cce8ac32cc0c33b4369294e8aca 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "If you feel energetic enough to respond, I hope you will consider it.\n\nI would like to request Kotoba Aoi who is happy but confused by the situation.\nI would like to request Kotohana Aoi who is happy but confused because she can't understand the situation.\nI'd like to see Akane call her \"big sister\" and miss her...!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MAME_CIVA/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/41df8408/uploads/origins/37e94acb-ad3d-48b5-8340-cd7a8c509a6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86cbbfac467321062a81693cb7d3a10d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/41df8408/uploads/origins/37e94acb-ad3d-48b5-8340-cd7a8c509a6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86cbbfac467321062a81693cb7d3a10d, https://si.imgix.net/41df8408/uploads/origins/37e94acb-ad3d-48b5-8340-cd7a8c509a6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52f55a411fe3978a49af3b8c33a404b6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/41df8408/uploads/origins/37e94acb-ad3d-48b5-8340-cd7a8c509a6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=893a631cb895fa42a96b6afa4b9ba459 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you very much for the illustration of the lovely Kotohana sisters last time!\nIf you don't mind, I'd like to make a request for the Kotoba sisters again.\n\nComposition.\nAs in the reference image.\n Aoi-chan is putting her face on Akane's head, and Aoi-chan is putting the cat on her own head.\n\nI'll leave the facial expressions and other elements other than the above composition to Ageshiomame.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MAME_CIVA/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cee698c/requests/185998_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09b76a67f98dae6af8efbe5cdc403157", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cee698c/requests/185998_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09b76a67f98dae6af8efbe5cdc403157, https://si.imgix.net/3cee698c/requests/185998_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70875bd4182461622a22080561affacd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cee698c/requests/185998_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78b1a9384ae2fb0194f0c71c6e696158 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I can't help it. ...... and laughing Aoi, please!\n\nA dumbfounded, accepting smile, please.\n\nWe will clearly state the author's name if you use it in a header or as an icon.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MAME_CIVA/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d96f4031/requests/148653_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80282f1d578e1a485e04da224d71f138", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d96f4031/requests/148653_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80282f1d578e1a485e04da224d71f138, https://si.imgix.net/d96f4031/requests/148653_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b311bd1f458272a28aa577f30c556160 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d96f4031/requests/148653_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd6626783225fbe9f1c2abac02d41b6f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Please take a look at Tetsusei Akari, who is happily trying to eat her shiloh noir.\n\nIf you'd like, I'd like to use it for my Twitter header, etc.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MAME_CIVA/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4938f05c/requests/142182_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7809af6b2190ef1cb867427ddc4efdd2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4938f05c/requests/142182_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7809af6b2190ef1cb867427ddc4efdd2, https://si.imgix.net/4938f05c/requests/142182_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8dcc04e7ca6be86ecf198cf5985e58f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4938f05c/requests/142182_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ec16a13a58cc3e2aef41d6d28ce8a02 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I would like to request Aoi-chan, who is happily rubbing her head against the cat.\nAnd behind such a happy Aoi-chan.\nAkane, who is looking at the scene with her cheeks puffed out as if she is a little jealous of the scene, please, too...!\n\nAlso, if possible, just use a small frame.\nIt would be great if you could also draw the scene where Akane is going to rub her head against Aoi's.\n\nFYI: Atmosphere of cat head rubbing (10 seconds and up)\nhttps://www.pinterest.jp/pin/37365871897414182/", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MAME_CIVA/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7bfe6469/requests/141255_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1b4b43e0c48381d5936a93d7e5f8ef1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7bfe6469/requests/141255_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1b4b43e0c48381d5936a93d7e5f8ef1, https://si.imgix.net/7bfe6469/requests/141255_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00a9b40470cc84a3ceeea5d2c188e94a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7bfe6469/requests/141255_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s